<title>TURKEY: Turkey to sell 25 pct stake in Eregli steel firm.</title>
<headline>Turkey to sell 25 pct stake in Eregli steel firm.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey will put on sale a 25 percent stake in steel company Eregli Demir ve Celik Fabrikalari, state minister Abdullah Gul said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The government holds a 51.66 percent stake in Eregli.</p>
</text>
